{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1731380770649.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">从交通不便的鄱阳湖小岛</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">到历史悠久的苗寨村落</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">从藏在崇山峻岭中的天坑之下</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">到城市的每一条大街小巷</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">总有一抹红色点缀其间</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他们是奔跑在路上的京东人</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">见证并记录</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这个时代的美好瞬间</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&mdash;&mdash;转自快递杂志</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #c91623; font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; background-color: #c91623;\">&nbsp;01&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">贵阳珠江路站点的京东小哥</