微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">只为履行送货上门的承诺</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1731380799185.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #c91623; font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; background-color: #c91623;\">&nbsp;04&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东小哥驱车70公里</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">来到鄱阳湖&ldquo;孤岛&rdquo;学校</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">将爱心人士购置的羽绒服及时送到</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1731380805734.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #c91623; font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; background-color: #c91623;\">&nbsp;05&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">奔跑在送递包裹路上的</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">也许还有红色的无人车</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">它们是京东小哥的&ldquo;亲密搭档&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1731380809857.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-heigh